sed_at":"2026-07-16T18:11:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in:\n- v4.8.dev1.official [ebbf577a0]\n- v4.7.1.stable.official [a13da4feb]\n- v4.7.stable.steam [5b4e0cb0f]\n\nNot reproducible in:\n- v4.6.stable.official [89cea1439]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Mobile) - dedicated Intel(R) UHD Graphics (Intel Corporation; 31.0.101.2140) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-10210U CPU @ 1.60GHz (8 threads) - 15.84 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAfter creating a new GDScript or .txt file (by right-clicking somewhere in the file system panel), the displayed weight value in the `FontVariation` inspector resets to the default value.\nThe editor renders text using the default weight, however, in the actual game it looks correct and has the weight I have set.\nAlso, if you open `.tres` file as text the `variation_opentype` values are valid.\nScreenshot (the editor vs. the game):\n<img width=\"1171\" height=\"907\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f69844c5-5550-4128-a198-db203b7a2a81\" />\n\nThis only seems to happen if the .tres file is set as the default font for the game in `Project Settings > GUI > Theme`.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Load the MRP\n2. Check that new_font_variation.tres has the weight 500 (or any weight except the default)\n3. Set the default font in the Project Settings to the new_font_variation.tres file\n4. Restart the editor\n5. Create a new .txt or a .gd file\n6. Switch back to the 2D workspace and notice that the label looks different\n7. Check the new_font_variation.tres file again. You'll notice that the displayed weight value had reset to the default one\n8. Run the game and notice the difference between the font weight in the game and the font weight in the editor\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30056375/MRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121419/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121419/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}